<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-CA">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#151922">
  <meta name="description" content="Find your next adventure with GA Checkpoint. Explore a concept collection of boats, marine electronics and essentials for life on the water.">
  <title>GA Checkpoint — Out there starts here.</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#catalog">Skip to the collection</a>
  <div class="announcement"><span>GOOD GEAR. GREAT DAYS ON THE WATER.</span><a href="#approach">Discover our approach <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></div>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a class="wordmark brand-logo" href="#home" aria-label="GA Checkpoint home"><img src="assets/ga-checkpoint-logo.svg" width="2100" height="440" alt="GA Checkpoint — Marine Parts &amp; Accessories"></a>
    <nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <button type="button" data-category="all" aria-current="page">Shop all</button>
      <button type="button" data-category="boats">Boats</button>
      <button type="button" data-category="electronics">Electronics</button>
      <button type="button" data-category="essentials">Essentials</button>
    </nav>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <button class="icon-button" id="search-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Search the collection"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="m16 16 4.5 4.5"/></svg></button>
      <button class="icon-button" id="wishlist-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Show saved products" aria-pressed="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.5 8.7c0 5-8.5 10.6-8.5 10.6S3.5 13.7 3.5 8.7A4.6 4.6 0 0 1 12 6.4a4.6 4.6 0 0 1 8.5 2.3Z"/></svg><span class="icon-counter" id="saved-count" hidden>0</span></button>
      <button class="bag-button" id="cart-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open shopping bag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 7h14l1 14H4L5 7ZM9 8V6a3 3 0 0 1 6 0v2"/></svg><span class="bag-label">Bag</span><span id="bag-count">0</span></button>
      <button class="icon-button menu-button" id="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-haspopup="dialog"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h18M3 16h18"/></svg></button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="home">
    <div class="scroll-scene scene-one" id="scene-1" aria-label="Start — marine collection">
    <section class="hero hero-carousel" id="hero-carousel" aria-labelledby="hero-title" aria-roledescription="carousel">
      <div class="hero-slides" id="hero-slides">
        <div class="hero-slide is-active" data-active="true" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="1 of 3" aria-hidden="false"><img id="hero-image-1" src="assets/hero.png" width="1672" height="941" alt="Concept inflatable boat sweeping across turquoise coastal water" fetchpriority="high"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" data-active="false" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="2 of 3" aria-hidden="true"><img id="hero-image-2" src="assets/hero-2.png" width="1672" height="941" alt="Concept inflatable boat exploring a sunlit mountain inlet"></div>
        <div class="hero-slide" data-active="false" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="3 of 3" aria-hidden="true"><img id="hero-image-3" src="assets/hero-3.png" width="1672" height="941" alt="Concept powerboat leaving a long white wake on the open ocean"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="mini-cross" aria-hidden="true">+</span> THE MARINE COLLECTION / GO FURTHER</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">OUT THERE.<br>STARTS HERE.</h1>
        <p class="hero-description">Less waiting for the weekend.<br>More finding your own way out.</p>
        <button class="button button-brand" type="button" data-category="all">Find your gear <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-bottom"><a class="hero-scroll" href="#catalog">SCROLL TO FIND YOUR GEAR <svg class="arrow-svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v16m-6-6 6 6 6-6"/></svg></a><div class="hero-slider-controls"><div class="slide-selectors" role="group" aria-label="Choose a hero image"><button type="button" class="slide-selector" data-slide="0" aria-label="Show image 1 of 3" aria-pressed="true">01<span class="slide-line" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><button type="button" class="slide-selector" data-slide="1" aria-label="Show image 2 of 3" aria-pressed="false">02<span class="slide-line" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><button type="button" class="slide-selector" data-slide="2" aria-label="Show image 3 of 3" aria-pressed="false">03<span class="slide-line" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div><button class="hero-pause" id="hero-pause" type="button" aria-label="Pause automatic image rotation" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="pause-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 5v14M15 5v14"/></svg><svg class="play-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8 5 11 7-11 7Z"/></svg></button></div></div>
    </section>

    </div>
    <section class="scroll-scene scene-two" id="scene-2" aria-label="Featured products and collection banner">
    <div class="scene-panel">
    <div class="ticker scroll-reveal-shell" data-scroll-reveal aria-label="Explore without limits"><div data-reveal-content><span>FIND YOUR CURRENT</span><span class="ticker-cross" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="star-svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 2v28M2 16h28M6.1 6.1l19.8 19.8M6.1 25.9 25.9 6.1"/></svg></span><span>TAKE THE LONG WAY</span><span class="ticker-cross" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="star-svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 2v28M2 16h28M6.1 6.1l19.8 19.8M6.1 25.9 25.9 6.1"/></svg></span><span>MAKE WAVES</span><span class="ticker-cross" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="star-svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 2v28M2 16h28M6.1 6.1l19.8 19.8M6.1 25.9 25.9 6.1"/></svg></span><span aria-hidden="true">FIND YOUR CURRENT</span><span class="ticker-cross" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="star-svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 2v28M2 16h28M6.1 6.1l19.8 19.8M6.1 25.9 25.9 6.1"/></svg></span></div></div>

    <section class="section catalog" id="catalog" aria-labelledby="catalog-title">
      <div class="catalog-intro scroll-reveal-shell" data-scroll-reveal><div data-reveal-content>
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CURATED FOR YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</p><h2 id="catalog-title">GOOD TO GO.</h2></div><p class="concept-note"><span></span>Concept collection<br> Sample products &amp; prices in CAD.</p></div>
      <div class="catalog-top">
        <div class="category-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Filter collection by category"><button type="button" class="active" data-category="all" aria-pressed="true">All gear <span>12</span></button><button type="button" data-category="boats" aria-pressed="false">Boats</button><button type="button" data-category="electronics" aria-pressed="false">Electronics</button><button type="button" data-category="essentials" aria-pressed="false">Essentials</button></div>
        <label class="search-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="m16 16 4.5 4.5"/></svg><span class="sr-only">Search products</span><input type="search" id="catalog-search" placeholder="Search your next adventure" autocomplete="off"></label>
      </div>
      <div class="catalog-toolbar"><div class="toolbar-left"><button class="filter-button" id="filter-toggle" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h16M4 17h16M8 4v6M16 14v6"/></svg>Filter <span id="filter-count" hidden></span></button><p id="result-count" role="status" aria-live="polite">12 items</p><button id="clear-filters" class="clear-button" type="button" hidden>Clear all</button></div><label class="sort-label">Sort by <select id="sort-by"><option value="featured">Featured</option><option value="price-asc">Price: low to high</option><option value="price-desc">Price: high to low</option><option value="name">Name: A–Z</option></select></label></div>
      </div></div>
      <div class="product-grid product-rail" id="product-grid" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Featured product row"></div><div class="row-navigation"><span>YOUR NEXT GOOD FIND IS RIGHT HERE.</span><div><button type="button" data-rail="product-grid" data-direction="-1" aria-label="Scroll featured products left"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 12H4m6-6-6 6 6 6"/></svg></button><button type="button" data-rail="product-grid" data-direction="1" aria-label="Scroll featured products right"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></button></div></div>
      <div class="empty-state" id="empty-state" hidden><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span><h3>ANOTHER WAY OUT.</h3><p id="empty-message">Try a different search or clear your filters.</p><button class="button button-dark" id="empty-reset" type="button">Show all gear</button></div>
      <noscript><p class="noscript-message">The shopping controls need JavaScript. Enable it to explore this concept collection.</p></noscript>
      <div class="collection-end"><span>LESS SCROLLING. MORE EXPLORING.</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span><span>THE NEXT GOOD DAY IS OUT THERE.</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="mid-banner" id="mid-banner" aria-labelledby="mid-banner-title"><img data-copy-image="hero-image-2" width="1672" height="941" alt="A sunlit mountain inlet with a boat on the water"><div class="mid-banner-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mid-banner-copy"><p class="eyebrow">NO PLANS. BETTER PLANS.</p><h2 id="mid-banner-title">TAKE THE<br>LONG WAY.</h2><p>The best part of getting out there?<br>Making it your own.</p><button class="button button-brand" type="button" data-category="essentials">Explore the essentials <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></button></div><button class="mid-banner-caption scene-continue" type="button" data-scene-go="2" aria-label="Continue to more products">MORE GEAR BELOW <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v16m-6-6 6 6 6-6"/></svg></button></section>
    </div>
    </section>
    <div class="scroll-scene scene-three" id="scene-3" aria-label="More products and stories">
    <section class="section secondary-collection" id="secondary-collection" aria-labelledby="secondary-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">PACK FOR THE POSSIBILITY</p><h2 id="secondary-title">SMALL DETAILS.<br>BIG DIFFERENCE.</h2></div><p class="secondary-intro">A few good essentials.<br>A whole lot of possibility.</p></div><div class="product-grid product-rail" id="secondary-grid" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="More marine essentials"></div><div class="row-navigation"><span>GOOD THINGS TO BRING ALONG.</span><div><button type="button" data-rail="secondary-grid" data-direction="-1" aria-label="Scroll more products left"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 12H4m6-6-6 6 6 6"/></svg></button><button type="button" data-rail="secondary-grid" data-direction="1" aria-label="Scroll more products right"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></button></div></div></section>
    <section class="section collections" id="collections" aria-labelledby="collections-title">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ONE GOOD PLACE TO START</p><h2 id="collections-title">PICK YOUR PURSUIT.</h2></div><button class="text-button" type="button" data-category="all">Explore everything <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></button></div>
      <div class="collection-grid">
        <button class="collection-card" type="button" data-category="boats"><span class="collection-image"><span class="tile-number">01 / EXPLORE</span><span class="product-photo" style="--photo-position:0% 0%" role="img" aria-label="Concept grey inflatable boat"></span></span><span class="collection-title">GET OUT THERE.<span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span><span class="collection-description">Boats &amp; inflatables</span></button>
        <button class="collection-card" type="button" data-category="electronics"><span class="collection-image"><span class="tile-number">02 / CONNECT</span><span class="product-photo" style="--photo-position:50% 0%" role="img" aria-label="Concept marine navigation display"></span></span><span class="collection-title">FIND YOUR WAY.<span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span><span class="collection-description">Marine electronics</span></button>
        <button class="collection-card" type="button" data-category="essentials"><span class="collection-image"><span class="tile-number">03 / EQUIP</span><span class="product-photo" style="--photo-position:100% 100%" role="img" aria-label="Concept orange waterproof dry bag"></span></span><span class="collection-title">BRING THE GOOD.<span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span><span class="collection-description">Parts &amp; essentials</span></button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="approach" id="approach" aria-labelledby="approach-title"><div class="approach-title"><p class="eyebrow">OUR KIND OF EVERYDAY</p><h2 id="approach-title">GOOD GEAR.<br>GREAT DAYS.</h2></div><div class="approach-copy"><span class="compass-mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="star-svg" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 2v28M2 16h28M6.1 6.1l19.8 19.8M6.1 25.9 25.9 6.1"/></svg></span><p>That first turn out of the harbour. A quiet cove you’ve never found before. Just one more hour outside.</p><p>We’re here for the moments that make getting out there worth it. Find your essentials. Make your own plans.</p><button class="button button-brand" type="button" data-category="boats">Find your way out <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></button></div></section>

    <section class="section field-notes" aria-labelledby="notes-title"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE KNOW-HOW GOES A LONG WAY</p><div class="notes-heading"><h2 id="notes-title">READY WHEN YOU ARE.</h2><p>Small details. Better days out.</p></div><div class="notes-grid"><article><span class="note-number">01</span><h3>Find your fit.</h3><p>Match your boat, crew and gear to the kind of days you want to have.</p><button class="text-button" type="button" data-category="boats">Explore boats <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></button></article><article><span class="note-number">02</span><h3>Know your heading.</h3><p>Make room for reliable navigation, a good plan and a little curiosity.</p><button class="text-button" type="button" data-category="electronics">Explore electronics <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></button></article><article><span class="note-number">03</span><h3>Pack the essentials.</h3><p>Protect what matters and keep the things you need close at hand.</p><button class="text-button" type="button" data-category="essentials">Explore essentials <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></button></article></div></section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer"><div class="footer-top"><div><p class="eyebrow">GO AHEAD. MAKE WAVES.</p><h2>SEE YOU<br>OUT THERE.</h2></div><div class="footer-links"><div><h3>THE COLLECTION</h3><button type="button" data-category="all">Shop all gear</button><button type="button" data-category="boats">Boats &amp; inflatables</button><button type="button" data-category="electronics">Marine electronics</button><button type="button" data-category="essentials">Parts &amp; essentials</button></div><div><h3>YOUR NEXT MOVE</h3><a href="#collections">Find your pursuit</a><a href="#approach">Our approach</a><button type="button" id="footer-saved">Saved gear</button><button type="button" id="concept-info">About this concept</button></div></div></div><div class="footer-bottom"><a href="#home" class="footer-wordmark">GA CHECKPOINT<span>.</span></a><span>MARINE / CANADA / CAD</span><a href="#home" class="back-top">Back to top <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></div><p class="footer-disclaimer">Independent storefront concept. Products, imagery and prices are illustrative.</p></footer>

  <dialog class="menu-dialog side-dialog" id="menu-dialog" aria-labelledby="menu-title"><div class="dialog-header"><h2 id="menu-title">EXPLORE.</h2><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close aria-label="Close navigation"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 5 14 14M19 5 5 19"/></svg></button></div><nav aria-label="Mobile navigation"><button type="button" data-category="all">All gear <span><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></button><button type="button" data-category="boats">Boats <span><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></button><button type="button" data-category="electronics">Electronics <span><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></button><button type="button" data-category="essentials">Essentials <span><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></button><a href="#approach" data-close>Our approach <span><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></nav><p class="menu-note">OUT THERE. STARTS HERE.</p></dialog>

  <dialog class="filter-dialog side-dialog" id="filter-dialog" aria-labelledby="filter-title"><form id="filter-form"><div class="dialog-header"><h2 id="filter-title">FIND YOUR GEAR.</h2><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close aria-label="Close filters"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 5 14 14M19 5 5 19"/></svg></button></div><div class="filter-fields"><label>Category<select id="filter-category"><option value="all">All gear</option><option value="boats">Boats</option><option value="electronics">Electronics</option><option value="essentials">Essentials</option></select></label><label>Maximum price (CAD)<input type="number" id="filter-price" min="0" max="100000" step="1" placeholder="Any price"><span class="field-hint">Leave blank to see every price.</span></label></div><div class="filter-actions"><button class="button button-dark" id="filter-apply" type="submit">Show results <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></button><button class="text-button" id="filter-reset" type="button">Reset filters</button></div></form></dialog>

  <dialog class="product-dialog" id="product-dialog" aria-labelledby="detail-name"><button class="icon-button detail-close" type="button" data-close aria-label="Close product details"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 5 14 14M19 5 5 19"/></svg></button><div class="detail-image"><div class="product-photo" id="detail-photo" role="img"></div></div><div class="detail-copy"><p class="eyebrow" id="detail-category"></p><h2 id="detail-name"></h2><p class="detail-price" id="detail-price"></p><p class="detail-description" id="detail-description"></p><ul id="detail-features"></ul><div class="detail-purchase"><label for="detail-quantity">Quantity<input type="number" id="detail-quantity" min="1" max="99" value="1" inputmode="numeric"></label><button class="button button-dark" id="detail-add" type="button">Add to bag <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button></div><p class="detail-concept">Concept product. Images and prices are illustrative.</p></div></dialog>

  <dialog class="cart-dialog side-dialog" id="cart-dialog" aria-labelledby="cart-title"><div class="dialog-header"><h2 id="cart-title">YOUR BAG<span class="brand-dot">.</span></h2><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close aria-label="Close shopping bag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 5 14 14M19 5 5 19"/></svg></button></div><div class="cart-empty" id="cart-empty"><span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span><h3>ROOM FOR ADVENTURE.</h3><p>Your next good find belongs here.</p><button class="button button-dark" type="button" data-category="all">Explore the collection</button></div><div class="cart-lines" id="cart-lines"></div><div class="cart-summary" id="cart-summary" hidden><div><span>Subtotal</span><strong id="cart-total">$0.00</strong></div><p>CAD · Demonstration prices. No payment will be collected.</p><button class="button button-brand" id="checkout-button" type="button">Review demo bag <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></button><button class="text-button" type="button" data-close>Keep exploring</button></div></dialog>

  <dialog class="info-dialog" id="checkout-dialog" aria-labelledby="checkout-title"><div class="dialog-header"><h2 id="checkout-title">YOUR NEXT ADVENTURE.</h2><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close aria-label="Close order review"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 5 14 14M19 5 5 19"/></svg></button></div><p class="eyebrow">CONCEPT STORE / BAG REVIEW</p><div id="checkout-summary"></div><p class="checkout-note">This is a concept storefront. Products and prices are illustrative. No payment is collected and no order will be placed.</p><button class="button button-dark" type="button" data-close>Keep exploring <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></button></dialog>

  <dialog class="info-dialog" id="info-dialog" aria-labelledby="info-title"><div class="dialog-header"><h2 id="info-title">A NEW WAY OUT.</h2><button class="icon-button" type="button" data-close aria-label="Close concept information"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 5 14 14M19 5 5 19"/></svg></button></div><p>This independent GA Checkpoint storefront concept explores a fresh approach to marine shopping. Every part of the interface was built from scratch.</p><p>The sample collection and generated imagery show a possible visual direction. They do not represent live stock, confirmed specifications or an offer for sale.</p><p>Saved products and your demonstration bag stay in this browser. No account or payment is required.</p><button class="button button-dark" type="button" data-close>Got it <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="arrow-svg up-right" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></button></dialog>
  <div class="toast" id="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
  <nav class="scene-navigation" aria-label="Page sections"><button type="button" data-scene-go="0" aria-label="Section 1: main collection" aria-current="step"><span>01</span></button><button type="button" data-scene-go="1" aria-label="Section 2: featured products and banner"><span>02</span></button><button type="button" data-scene-go="2" aria-label="Section 3: more products"><span>03</span></button></nav>
  <script src="app.js"></script>
  <script src="scenes.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
